flowchart TD
    CARPIS[CARPIS System]
    
    CARPIS --> AUTH[Authentication & Authorization]
    AUTH --> LOGIN[Login/Register]
    AUTH --> PWDRESET[Password Reset]
    AUTH --> VERIFY[Email Verification]
    AUTH --> ADMIN[Admin Role Management]
    
    CARPIS --> EMP[Employee Management]
    EMP --> EMPCRUD[CRUD: Create/Read/Update/Delete]
    EMP --> EMPARCH[Archive/Unarchive Employees]
    EMP --> EMPINFO[Personal Info: Name, Sex, Contact, DOB]
    EMP --> EMPPOS[Position & Assignment]
    EMP --> EMPDIV[Division/Section/Unit Assignment]
    EMP --> EMPSALARY[Salary Grade Tracking]
    EMP --> EMPIMPORT[Excel Import]
    
    CARPIS --> INV[Inventory Management]
    INV --> INVCRUD[CRUD: Create/Read/Update/Delete]
    INV --> INVARCH[Archive Inventory Items]
    INV --> INVDETAILS[Asset Details: Serial, Property No, Condition]
    INV --> INVASSIGN[Assign Assets to Employees]
    INV --> INVQR[QR Code Generation & Tagging]
    INV --> INVIMAGE[Asset Image Upload]
    
    CARPIS --> USER[User Management]
    USER --> USERCRUD[CRUD: Create/Read/Update/Delete Users]
    USER --> USERARCH[Archive/Unarchive Users]
    USER --> USERADMIN[Admin User Index View]
    
    CARPIS --> DASH[Dashboard & Analytics]
    DASH --> DASHSTATS[Employee Statistics by Unit/Assignment]
    DASH --> DASHCHART[Gender Distribution Charts]
    DASH --> DASHFILLED[Filled Positions Tracking]
    
    CARPIS --> ORG[Organization Setup]
    ORG --> ORGUNIT[Create Org Units (Div/Sec)]
    ORG --> POS[Create Positions with Item Codes]
    ORG --> POSSTATUS[Position Status: Vacant/Occupied]
    ORG --> ASSIGN[Create Assignment Places]
    ORG --> SALARY[Assign Salary Grades to Positions]
    
    CARPIS --> PROFILE[User Profile & Settings]
    PROFILE --> PROF[View/Edit Profile]
    PROFILE --> PROFPWD[Change Password]
    PROFILE --> PROFAPP[Appearance Settings]
